== Notes ==
	
* Despite its description, this spell belongs to the necromancy school. ''(Possibly a bug.)''
* The mind-affecting effects of [[paralyze|paralysis]], [[dominated|dominate]], and [[fear]] are blocked, but not removed by this spell.  
* Due to a .2da bug, ''charm person'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

=== Previous versions ===

* Prior to version 1.69, this spell could not be cast with the [[still spell]] feat.

